<http://data.silknow.org/object/d1bd7c90-9743-3ab4-9ef5-209fd342099c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Figured, ribbed ivory taffeta, liseré ground. Design, in bright polychrome silks and *gilt thread and wire, shows three undulating bight green vines from which grow violet, blue, yellow, terracotta and gold blossoms.  **Panel made of two pieced widths sewn together  down middle. Condidtion fair; a few worn and darned areas.\n*lamé and frisé are lancé, not brocaded\n** Pillement style"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1bd7c90-9743-3ab4-9ef5-209fd342099c> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/d1bd7c90-9743-3ab4-9ef5-209fd342099c>
